<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Building a Cage, 2005</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Northern Africa Islamic League vs Spain&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Date/Time: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;15th September, 2005 / 16:00:00 Zulu&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Location: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Canary Islands / &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "st1" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:PlaceName w:st="on"&gt;Moroccan&lt;/st1:PlaceName&gt; &lt;st1:PlaceType w:st="on"&gt;Coast&lt;/st1:PlaceType&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Playable Sides: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "u3" /&gt;&lt;u3:country-region u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;u3:place u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;NAIL&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;September&amp;nbsp;2005. Islamic extremist parties have come to power in several Arab countries. &lt;u3:country-region u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Algeria&lt;/u3:country-region&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; was the first, despite of the efforts of Western Allies on both sides of &lt;u3:place u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Atlantic&lt;/u3:place&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt; to stop these regimes. Soon, all North African countries fell under the rule of N.A.I.L., Northern Africa Islamic League, including Egypt, Libya, Algeria, Tunisia and the&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;surprisingly the pro-western Kingdom of Morocco. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;u3:country-region u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Morocco&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/u3:country-region&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;, with the help from other NAIL countries, pressed her ancient claim of the African Spanish cities of &lt;u3:State u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:State w:st="on"&gt;Ceuta&lt;/u3:State&gt;&lt;/st1:State&gt; and &lt;u3:State u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;u3:place u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:State w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Melilla&lt;/u3:place&gt;&lt;/u3:State&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:State&gt;. The relationship between &lt;u3:country-region u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Spain&lt;/u3:country-region&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; and &lt;u3:country-region u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Morocco&lt;/u3:country-region&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; had deteriorated sharply after Perejil Islot affair and the &lt;u3:place u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Western Sahara&lt;/u3:place&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt; referendum. &lt;u3:country-region u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;u3:place u2:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Spain&lt;/u3:place&gt;&lt;/u3:country-region&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; answered by reinforcing her military at those two cities. To celebrate one year of NAIL creation a general military exercise is underway in &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Morocco&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; with participation of all NAIL countries forces.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Author: Miguel Molina “Meroka37”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Note: This scenario happens just before “Canary’s Cage”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/u3:place&gt;&lt;/u3:country-region&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
